# Negating the smallest `long` overflows.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| take 1
| extend x = -(tolong(amount) * 0 - 9223372036854775807 - 1)
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `-` does not fit in a `long`
  --> query:3:14
  |
3 | | extend x = -(tolong(amount) * 0 - 9223372036854775807 - 1)
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: a `long` holds whole numbers from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807
